 unity feedback system is shown below:</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/16798141bd54926a04f02669a9a80c3683b1392c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>If a, b are magnitudes (in dB) of bode plot at frequencies 1 rad/sec and 50 rad/sec. The value of (<em>a</em> + <em>b</em>) is _______.</div></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"-1.93","high":"-1.93"},"solution":"<p>-1.93 (-2.0 - -1.9)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/385a966cbe9d887e0103d729419004b6edf6c4d6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":28,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>A lead-lag compensating network is given by</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/0049d7b6342ccd577116e9ecf983e2b352c85a51.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>The value of <img src=\"/media/197ea57439d63905a022bf2a8b72efd2e5e30804.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> is _______ degree.</div></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"180","high":"180"},"solution":"<p>180</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/8fe93929eecf92a4d6c3c0f9244c006b86d445fb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":29,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>A controller of the form <em>G<sub>c</sub></em>(<em>s</em>) = <img src=\"/media/a1dd1505e7e911d0968f96205218a723b302b7a4.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> is designed for a plant with transfer function <img src=\"/media/4f67c681189dc7fc5ab68a6b8fbf6072721a05a0.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> such that the undamped natural frequency and damping ratio are 2 rad/sec and 0.5 respectively. When the steady state error due to a unit ramp is 0.50, then the value of <em>K</em> + <em>a</em> + <em>b</em> is _________ .</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"9","high":"9"},"solution":"<p>9 (9 - 9)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/8d36a10a86a3d24458b82558eab3da377